===Time for a Trade===
Visit the house next to the Pokémon Center to find an old man who would like to [[trade]] Pokémon. He is willing to part with his {{p|Jynx}} in exchange for a {{p|Poliwhirl}}. Poliwhirl can only be found by using a [[Super Rod|high-level fishing rod]].

===Gym Badges, Explained===
The northwest house belongs to a man who offers to explains the effects of the eight {{DL|Badge|Indigo League|Gym Badges}}. Half of them give a slight power boost to a respective stat, while the other half ensure a Pokémon's [[obedience]] during battle. The first seven unlock the use of field moves.

